  <abstract format="text/plain" language="en" script="Latn">Recommendation ITU-T J.1302 defines the high-level system architecture of a cloud-based converged media service to support Internet protocol (IP) and broadcast cable television (TV). With the cloud-native technology development, cloud-based converged media services can be quickly deployed by cable television operators. This Recommendation is part 2 of a multi-part deliverable.Corrigendum 1 corrects the definition for API gateway.</abstract>
